current_state:
  - MiniModel.org is the Rust-first P2P tiny model package exchange roadmap site.
  - Source options are user-owned local files/lists, user-triggered Hugging Face discovery, and future consent-based P2P transfer; all converge on local `.slm` verification.
  - First implementation docs now route manifest v0, the local Rust verifier MVP, metadata-only catalog boundaries, and examples without model-byte hosting.
  - The live public-safe export is verified.
  - Direct public .uai and agent-file-handoff access is denied.
